# Nexus Verge - Environment Variables Template
# Copy this file to .env for local development (DO NOT commit .env)

# ==================== Roger AI Configuration ====================
# Azure Entra ID (formerly Azure AD) authentication for Roger
# Get these from Azure Portal → App Registrations → Your App

ROGER_ENTRA_CLIENT_ID=your-entra-client-id-here
ROGER_ENTRA_CLIENT_SECRET=your-entra-client-secret-here

# Azure AI Projects (Azure AI Foundry)
# Get these from Azure Portal → AI Foundry → Your Project

ROGER_PROJECT_ENDPOINT=https://your-name.services.ai.azure.com/api/projects/your-project
ROGER_AGENT_NAME=Roger
# ROGER_AGENT_VERSION=7  # Optional - omit to use latest agent version

# ==================== Notes ====================
# 1. Never commit this file with real values
# 2. Add secrets to Azure Static Web Apps → Configuration in production
# 3. For local development with Roger, use Azure Static Web Apps CLI:
#    npm install -g @azure/static-web-apps-cli
#    swa start . --port 8000
# 4. Authentication uses DefaultAzureCredential (managed identity in Azure)
#    For local dev, use Azure CLI: az login
